*Italy advanced to play Norway (runner-up of [[1998 FIFA World Cup Group A|Group A]]) in the [[1998 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Italy vs Norway|round of 16]].
*Chile advanced to play Brazil (winner of [[1998 FIFA World Cup Group A|Group A]]) in the [[1998 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Brazil vs Chile|round of 16]].

